<title>USA: Nu Skin shoots higher ahead of NYSE opening.</title>
<headline>Nu Skin shoots higher ahead of NYSE opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nu Skin Asia Pacific Inc shot up ahead of the cosmetic company's market debut on the New York Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>The shares were indicated at $30 to $32, according to the NYSE, far above its IPO price of $23. Previously, the shares were indicated at $29-$34.</p>
<p>The company increased both the number of shares, to 9.1 million from 7.6 million, and the estimated pricing range, to $22-$24 from $20-$22.  </p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1881</p>
</text>
